WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.910 --> 00:00:12.800
New research claims that almost all dinosaurs
had feathers.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:18.609
'You have a turd in your teeth' was a common
insult in 17th-century England.

00:00:18.609 --> 00:00:25.650
Matt LeBlanc was down to his last $11 when
he got the part of Joey in Friends.

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:31.250
Two-thirds of all bankruptcies in the US are
caused by medical bills.

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:36.570
The busiest polling station in the Australian
elections is in London.

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:40.550
Whales can't taste anything but salt.

00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:45.700
More than 80,000 bartenders in America have
university degrees.

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:52.060
There's a tree in South Africa so big that
a pub has been built inside its trunk.

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:56.960
Hermit crabs form gangs to steal shells from
other hermit crabs.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:00.400
You could shatter a diamond with a hammer.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:06.940
Diamonds may be one of nature's hardest materials
but they're not the toughest; there's a difference.

00:01:06.940 --> 00:01:11.020
The toughest gemstone is actually nephrite
jade.

00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:16.350
The world's largest chicken nugget is twice
the size of the world's largest chicken.

00:01:16.350 --> 00:01:21.250
Half the world's population has a genetic
mutation that makes Brussels sprouts taste

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:22.610
extremely nasty.

00:01:22.610 --> 00:01:28.030
A 'quarter pounder' weighs less than a fifth
of a pound when cooked.

00:01:28.030 --> 00:01:34.390
People who try to stop thinking about chocolate
eat more of it than those who don't.

00:01:34.390 --> 00:01:41.560
The first time Hitler and Mussolini met, Mussolini
described Hitler as a 'mad little clown'.

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:49.600
Due to a computer error in 1989, 41,000 Parisians
received letters charging them with murder,

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:56.710
extortion and prostitution instead of traffic
offences.

